---
author: Vig Ranch
published: 2025-06-02
rating: 5
---
Brink Design set up reliable WiFi coverage across our ranch yard, including the shop and Horse Shed. The new system is fast, consistent, and covers all the areas we use daily. We really appreciate how they used wireless bridges to avoid running long cables—everything works great, and it’s ready to expand if we ever need more. Highly recommend them for rural network installs.
